{"id":888414,"title":"03下｜领域术语总混淆？构建精准术语词库，提升检索一致性","content":"<ul>\n<li>PPT、素材、代码下载链接：<a href=\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1pGBb889zbqf89HW-gbfNFQ?pwd=HY1b\">https://pan.baidu.com/s/1pGBb889zbqf89HW-gbfNFQ?pwd=HY1b</a></li>\n<li>提示：本节课因实战特殊性，PPT 在【术语词库.ipynb】里</li>\n</ul>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401237,"user_name":"麦耀锋","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1401327,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"077DA831185C01","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/15/61/ef/ac5e914d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1751361576,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101054401,"comment_content":"4.1节“查询改写与重写”的例子里面，MultiQueryRetriever实际上是利用LLM模型的能力来改写查询，这个跟之前自行准备的领域术语没有关系，简而言之，LLM越强，这个改写能力越好。但问题是，如果对于一些非常专业的词汇，LLM本身没有这方面的知识，没办法改写好。业界的做法一般是将私有领域的术语做到MultiQueryRetriever的prompt里面。但您的例子并没有看到这部分","like_count":4,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2001694,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/8b/1e/d2db672a.jpg","nickname":"llll","note":"","ucode":"1276A038369ECA","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668926,"discussion_content":"能介绍下或者给个链接吗？","content_length":12,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1753435341,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"河南","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":401238,"user_name":"麦耀锋","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1401327,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"077DA831185C01","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/15/61/ef/ac5e914d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1751361629,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101054401,"comment_content":"4.2 节“假设性文档嵌入（HyDE）”，但内容却是混合检索","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":401225,"user_name":"王亚南","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1082099,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"F127F8118E303C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/82/f3/01bf3b3e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1751329413,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101054401,"comment_content":"讲的非常细致啊，很实用，感觉超值了。","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":401656,"user_name":"舒小龙","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1948882,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"3397C268A274B1","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/bc/d2/d5e5f190.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1753182609,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101054401,"comment_content":"4.2 假设性文档嵌入 (HyDE)的langchain的例子，如果openAI key没有的话可以做响应的替换。也能跑，具体步骤\n\n# 替代方案示例（使用开源模型）\nfrom langchain_huggingface import HuggingFaceEmbeddings\nfrom langchain_community.llms import HuggingFacePipeline\n\n# 3. 创建向量数据库\n# embeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\n# 替换嵌入模型\nembeddings = HuggingFaceEmbeddings(model_name=&quot;BAAI&#47;bge-small-zh&quot;)\nvectorstore = FAISS.from_documents(docs, embeddings)\n\n# 4. 初始化LLM和检索器\n# llm = ChatOpenAI(temperature=0)\n# 替换LLM\nllm = HuggingFacePipeline.from_model_id(\n    model_id=&quot;Qwen&#47;Qwen1.5-0.5B-Chat&quot;,\n    task=&quot;text-generation&quot;\n)","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":401381,"user_name":"我在学编程","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2339039,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"5BD4619C67D66D","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/vDQCL1bnecibWJbvA7iaZiaem9ibI0HraibG4CM4SlfUrnJIjvXwquQuQ5NlARTCib8iaV3bQ4qnBXQrj6kFWEkfU3IMg/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1751951623,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101054401,"comment_content":"# 3. 创建向量数据库\nembeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\nvectorstore = FAISS.from_documents(docs, embeddings)\n\n# --- MultiQueryRetriever 实现 ---\n\n# 4. 初始化LLM和检索器\nllm = ChatOpenAI(temperature=0)\nretriever_from_llm = MultiQueryRetriever.from_llm(\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(), llm=llm\n)\n这里的代码可以替换成其他的模型吗","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":401246,"user_name":"Masquerade","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1886813,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"00F7FE50A529D7","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1c/ca/5d/85db4c14.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1751417076,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101054401,"comment_content":"老师，后续会讲word里面有表格的场景处理方式吗？就是问答会涉及到文档中的文字和表格混合结果","like_count":0}]}